{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1334.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"cb8345f033906e28fb9d9440e4ad866f00def3668258d95fa27edfed3fc7c2ce","ja":"応援されてるとちょっと違うような気がしてさ。\nみんなには、いつもどおりに接してほしかったんだ。","zh":"被大家加油打气总觉得有点别扭。\n我其实希望大家能像平时那样对待我。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1334.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"d0e3f9e7bb19bf281dea64d192d8854228af34ebf9ea708584f173077a064c8c","ja":"それで、歌詞は思いついたの？","zh":"所以，想到歌词了吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
